00:01:46,630 --> 00:01:50,920
EPISODE 7: LIFE WITH THE GRANVELLES

3
00:01:46,830 --> 00:01:50,210
Go right more! Too far, dummy!

4
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:51,710
Jeez, Allen!

5
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:53,420
Stand up straight!

6
00:01:53,460 --> 00:01:55,580
Are you my manservant or not?!

7
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:57,290
Of course...

8
00:01:57,830 --> 00:02:00,960
I can't reach because you're such a shorty.

9
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:03,880
Then please try standing on my shoulders instead.

10
00:02:04,250 --> 00:02:05,420
Good idea.

11
00:02:05,670 --> 00:02:07,750
But I'll have your head if I slip and fall!

12
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:10,710
I'm THIS close to just throwing her off.

13
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:12,290
Get on your tippy-toes!

14
00:02:12,540 --> 00:02:13,250
Okay.

15
00:02:14,250 --> 00:02:15,580
Got it!

16
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,670
Ew, gross!

17
00:02:18,670 --> 00:02:21,830
Well, they do say fruits that grow
on high trees tend to be sour.

18
00:02:21,830 --> 00:02:24,830
Hold on. Did you know it wasn't edible?!

19
00:02:24,830 --> 00:02:25,460
As-if.

20
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:26,580
Come again?

21
00:02:26,580 --> 00:02:28,670
No, milady. I had no idea.

22
00:02:29,130 --> 00:02:30,750
Hmph! Whatever.

23
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:35,080
I want to cleanse my palate with a popo fruit.
Go fetch me one from the market.

24
00:02:35,330 --> 00:02:36,750
Right away.

25
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:45,750
Is that an... airship?

26
00:02:45,750 --> 00:02:48,750
What are you, stupid? That's a magic ship.
Haven't you seen one before?

27
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,960
A magic ship?

28
00:02:51,790 --> 00:02:54,210
I did see some of the tools powered
by magic stones that Pelomas mentioned,

29
00:02:54,210 --> 00:02:58,210
like a clock and lights... but nothing like this!

30
00:02:59,830 --> 00:03:02,080
Go to the market when you're finished, okay?

31
00:03:10,670 --> 00:03:12,420
I slept great!

32
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:15,750
A world of difference
from sleeping in those shitty net cafes.

