230
00:09:12,380 --> 00:09:13,000
Here!

231
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:15,790
Sh-shucks, my apologies!

232
00:09:15,790 --> 00:09:17,830
Didn't realize you were one of the Granvelles.

233
00:09:17,830 --> 00:09:19,040
No problem!

234
00:09:19,460 --> 00:09:21,290
Makes sense why they told me to hang onto this.

235
00:09:21,290 --> 00:09:23,500
It's basically a free pass in and out of the city.

236
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:27,880
Open the gates!

237
00:09:29,580 --> 00:09:30,000
Alright!

238
00:09:30,290 --> 00:09:32,540
Wait, young sir! Don't you need a guard?

239
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:35,210
I'm free to go battle as many monsters as I want!

240
00:09:35,330 --> 00:09:38,040
I've been waiting eight years for this day!

241
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:40,170
Let's gooooo!

242
00:09:40,170 --> 00:09:41,250
Young sir!

243
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:43,130
And there he goes...

244
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:48,290
I shouldn't stray very far from town
or else the monsters will be too strong.

245
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:51,790
I'll aim for some D-ranks
around the 10 kilometer mark.

246
00:09:54,500 --> 00:09:56,040
